  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Why
    nextNodeID: Revealation
    text: Are you okay? What happened?
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Revealation
    nextNodeID: Coward
    text: "\u2026My dog protects my barn every night. He was gone last night chasing
      someone.. Had to go look for him all the way to Lydos' land.."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Aigidios
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Coward
    nextNodeID: choices1
    text: "Saw a silhouette in the dark in his storage\u2026 Guess that was why my
      dog was alerted. My dog bit him before he ran away.. but I was such a coward
      to not approach it."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Aigidios
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: choices1
    nextNodeID: 
    text: 
    choices:
    - text: Anyone would be hesitant.
      nextNodeID: Care
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    - text: "I don\u2019t blame you."
      nextNodeID: Care
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Care
    nextNodeID: Hurt
    text: "\u2026Thank you. \u2026I should probably talk to Lydos about this, but
      I haven\u2019t talked to him in a long time. He\u2019s not been a great friend,
      but I still care. "
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Aigidios
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Hurt
    nextNodeID: Break
    text: "Even though Artopoios\u2026 would not understand. But I\u2019m also worried
      about him - he hurt himself yesterday pretty badly."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Aigidios
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: Break
    nextNodeID: 
    text: "\u2026My friends give me headaches. I should go in and take a break\u2026
